  "summary": "The copied export menu exports HTML, Markdown and Word from one chosen projection. With pending suggestions it offers Apply (proposed) or Omit (accepted), defaulting from the mounted view, plus a separate Export as Word with tracked changes (review). HTML and Markdown use a menu-owned export editor with BaseEditorKit and DefaultAuthoredPlugin and the package authored adapters, so no package API or cast was added. Raster PDF/Image and html2canvas-pro/pdf-lib are removed. HTML inlines the app’s own stylesheets instead of linking platejs.org. docx-demo sets a user so Suggestion mode records suggestions. Docs, registry metadata, changelog and generated registry output match.",
